our tether."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Live with lightness and amusement bright,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "That\u2019s life, that\u2019s my movement, my light."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}